import QEC.Stabilizer.Foundations.PauliGroupSingle
import QEC.Stabilizer.Foundations.PauliGroup
import QEC.Stabilizer.Foundations.BinarySymplectic

/-!
# Foundations

The algebra underlying the stabilizer formalism, independent of any code:

- `PauliGroupSingle`: the single-qubit Pauli group.
- `PauliGroup`: the n-qubit Pauli group, its matrix representation and its
  commutation theory.
- `BinarySymplectic`: the binary symplectic representation of Pauli operators
  and check matrices.
-/
